{"version":1,"content":"<p>現正就讀於美國紐約大學的「聲夢小花」姚焯菲（Chantel），近日在社交網分享一輯與友人舉辦睡衣派對的照片。</p><p>相中，她身穿一套粉紅色吊帶睡衣，帶有可愛的荷葉邊作點綴，加上白色喱士襪，充滿少女的甜美氣息。</p><p>Chantel戴上毛茸茸的眼罩，嘟嘴賣萌</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.675169+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T16:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:28.082726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:28.082726+00:00","content_hash":"e06c686769a481a454f67c5a4ec2cdba3c08138e52b19f26cc67d1eefd72b982","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}